# CodeGraph — Third-Party Notice

This product (Mora) includes the `codegraph` software
(https://github.com/colbymchenry/codegraph) as the code-symbol / call-graph /
impact-query capability provider, integrated as an independent sidecar process
(ADR-0001, accepted 2026-08-15).

