## Integration notes

Mora invokes codegraph exclusively through the CodeGraphProvider port
(design-docs/12 §10.2) via the adapter at `internal/infra/codegraph/`. Mora does
not import codegraph's internal package paths, does not fork its control plane,
and does not pass Mora credentials to the sidecar — the sidecar receives only
short-lived service credentials and a trimmed AuthzContext (design-docs/11 §6).
The baseline is locked to commit c6aaa20; upgrades require revising ADR-0001
and re-running the third-party gate.
